SUMMARY:Soil Matters
DESCRIPTION:Healthy soil is the most important ingredient in your gardening success. Armed with knowledge you can understand your soil’s profile (and why it’s important)\, improve your soil’s texture\, nutrients and structure\, and support the soil food web by harnessing the benefits of microorganisms and earthworms. A handful of “living” soil is a beauty to behold! \nHosted by the Markham Garden and Horticultural Society
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/soil-matters/
LOCATION:ON
END:VEVENT
