SUMMARY:The Orchid: Daunting Diva\, Evocative Evolutionary or Humble Houseplant? Steeles Library
DESCRIPTION:fascinating stories\, fun facts and tips on orchid care. Love them already but yours don’t bloom? Don’t fret! We have answers. Have disease and pest problems? We help you solve them. Plus\, the best orchids to grow in your home. Suitable for gardeners of any skill level.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/the-orchid-daunting-diva-evocative-evolutionary-or-humble-houseplant-steeles-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Steeles Branch\, 375 Bamburgh Cir C107\, Scarborough\, Ontario\, M1W 3Y1
END:VEVENT
